## EXPERIMENT (not a library change): an operator whose look-ahead evaluation is failure is rejected (not only made worst),
## so the soar-base tie-breaker can no longer pick it when the remaining candidates are all cut off by depth.
sp {experiment*compare*selection*failure-evaluation-reject
   :default
   (state <s> ^name selection
              ^superstate <superstate>
              ^evaluation <e>)
   (<superstate> ^desireds <desireds>)
   (<e> ^symbolic-value failure
        ^desireds.duplicate-of <desireds>
        ^super-operator <o>
        ^closed true)
-->
   (<superstate> ^operator <o> -)}
